Catholics were the largest religious group in Uganda wi th 42 percent of the total
population while 37 percent of the population were o f the Anglican/Church of Uganda
beliefs. The Moslems came third with 12 percent. Chr istianity was predominant being
practiced by 85 percent of the population.

